# Never commit data, screenshots or logs.  Everything under walk/out, every camera frame and every
# screenshot of the viewer comes from the PhysicalAI-AV dataset, whose license forbids sharing it
# in whole or in part (docs/model-and-data.md).  `git add -f` gets past these rules: don't.

# data, captures, analysis, results
/walk/out/
*.pt
*.safetensors
*.parquet
*.mp4
*.pdf
/*.json
selftest*.json

# screenshots and recordings
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp
*.gif
*.webm

# logs
/logs/
*.log

# Hugging Face caches, should HF_HOME / HF_HUB_CACHE / --local-dir ever point inside the
# repository (keep them outside; this is only a safety net)
models--*/
datasets--*/
/.cache/
xet/
token
stored_tokens

# local environment: upstream clone, venv, uv, Chrome profiles, bytecode
/alpamayo2/
/.venv/
/tools/
chrome-prof-*/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
